      "description": "A narrow figure under a wide flat-brimmed iron hat, carrying a broad iron brazier basket mounted on a back frame so that it rides across the shoulders and sticks out well past them on both sides. The basket is a long horizontal cage of thick vertical iron ribs with fire visible only in the gaps between the ribs, and its top edge is flat. Heavy wide upper mass over a narrow waist, narrow legs and small feet, so the whole shape is top-heavy. Both hands hang empty at the sides. Short belted cloth tunic, no armour plate.",
